# Single-repo Python — cooperative MRO order
#
# Coverage target: multiple-inheritance method resolution. The answer
# must give the four-class MRO order and the role of each mixin —
# flattening the chain or reversing the mixins is a wrong answer.
ID="sr_py_mro_order"
NAME="python mro — JsonPlugin handle resolution order"
FIXTURE="eval/fixtures/python-plugin-mro"
QUESTION="调用 JsonPlugin().handle(payload) 时，方法解析顺序（MRO）是怎样的？TimestampMixin 和 ValidationMixin 各自做什么、谁先执行？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="JsonPlugin TimestampMixin ValidationMixin BasePlugin"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(TimestampMixin).*(ValidationMixin).*(BasePlugin)
(TimestampMixin).*(时间|戳|timestamp|ingested)|(时间戳|timestamp|ingested).*(TimestampMixin)
(ValidationMixin).*(校验|验证|valid|body)|(校验|验证|valid).*(ValidationMixin)"
